Not included in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

JaVaFo (https://www.rrweb.org/javafo/), Copyright Roberto Ricca, is NOT
open source and is NOT bundled here. It is invoked only by opt-in,
:javafo-tagged comparison tests, against a jar the user supplies.

Gacrux / TieBreakServer (https://github.com/OttoMilvang/TieBreakServer) is
likewise not vendored; it is located at runtime for comparison testing
only.
